"` which would be dynamically selected and populated based on the detected OS.

Within a `uses` statement in YANG, `refine` is used to modify existing nodes from the included grouping, while `augment` is used to add new nodes to the data tree at the point where the grouping is instantiated. For example, to refine a leaf's type and augment a list with a new leaf:
```yang
container my-container {
  uses my-grouping {
    refine "/my-grouping/my-leaf" {
      type string {
        length "1..10";
      }
    }
    augment "/my-grouping/my-list" {
      leaf new-leaf {
        type boolean;
      }
    }
  }
}
```
